      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那一天，聚集在病房里的每个人\n都拉着莱茵力量的手，\n衷心希望她能醒来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acdc5e33a4ca9db1693d02152f166a90253b6787dcd21d14ef064cfc4902fac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
